## ObjectType: equipment role

Source label: equipment role. Source IRI: `https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/EquipmentRole`. Source definition: role held by a material artifact or an engineered system when it is planned to be involved in or is involved in carrying out some part of a planned process and that is not consumed in that planned process

